                <p>Source: National Archives and Records Administration, RG 59, Conference Files: Lot 67 D 305, CF 8. Secret. Drafted by
                        Judd and cleared by U on February 3 and by S on February 4. The memorandum is Part 1 of 3. The meeting was
                    held in the Secretary’s office.</p>
            </note>
